d-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-pink\">ANXIETY<br>DISORDER</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">你不必驯服焦虑，只需让它与你同行。<span class=\"attr\">– 卡里·波特</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card bg-blue\">\n      <h3>抑郁症</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-blue\">DEPRESSION</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">即使在黑暗中，星星也会继续闪耀。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Row 2 -->\n    <div class=\"card bg-yellow\">\n      <h3>创伤后应激障碍</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-orange\">PTSD</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">你不必忘记，但你可以学会生活在过去之外</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card bg-green\">\n      <h3>强迫症</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-green\">OCD</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">不要让强迫控制你，你可以控制强迫。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Row 3 -->\n    <div class=\"card bg-teal\">\n      <h3>双相情感障碍</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-cyan\">BIPOLAR</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">黑暗会过去，黎明会到来。<span class=\"attr\">–乔治·戈登·拜伦</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card bg-navy\">\n      <h3>失眠症</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-navy\">INSOMNIA<br>DISORDER</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">即使黑夜漫长，你仍然有力量迎接黎明的曙光。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Row 4 -->\n    <div class=\"card bg-gold\">\n      <h3>进食障碍</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-yellow\">EATING<br>DISORDER</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">用爱和关怀填充你的盘子，让自由和平衡的味道充满你的生活。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card bg-purple\">\n      <h3>精神分裂症</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-purple\">SCHIZOPHRENIA</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">我并不疯狂，只是在一个我自己创造的世界里生活。<span class=\"attr\">– 弗里茨·佩尔斯</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Row 5 -->\n    <div class=\"card bg-rose\">\n      <h3>边缘人格障碍</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-red\">BPD</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">Borderline Personality Disorder</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card bg-magenta\">\n      <h3>妄想性人格障碍</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-magenta\">PPD</div>\n        <div class=\"quote\">在现实和想象之间找到平衡，让现实的光芒驱散妄想的阴影。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">@ 晓老师 成长教练</div>\n  <div class=\"watermark-bottom\">@ 晓老师 成长教练</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
